{"id":"beiseite","lemma":"beiseite","pos":"adv","rank":3487,"glosses":["away; out of one’s way; aside (more forceful, resolute; often figurative)","aside (to a place where one can talk in confidence)"],"ipa":"/baɪ̯ˈzaɪ̯tə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c3/De-beiseite.ogg/De-beiseite.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Bitte geht beiseite.","en":"Please step aside.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393693","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},null]},{"text":"Bitte gehen Sie beiseite.","en":"Please step aside.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394320","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to go, to walk"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null]},{"text":"Spaß beiseite, was versuchst du zu sagen?","en":"Joking aside, what are you trying to say?","words":[{"g":"fun"},null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"}]},{"text":"Er schob mich beiseite und ging.","en":"He pushed past me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to push","l":"schieben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"}]},{"text":"Bitte geh beiseite.","en":"Please step aside.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393692","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},null]}]}